  "output": {
    "section_id": "ch01.s04",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.01",
            "text": "Why do large language models matter so much now, and why are they attracting so much attention across applications and careers?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.02",
            "text": "A simple contrast shows how far natural language processing has come.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.03",
            "text": "One early chatbot from 50 to 60 years ago was \"Elisa\", one of the first chatbots humans developed, and its conversation quickly proceeds nowhere.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@224",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@227",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@230",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@232",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@235",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@298",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@300",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@303",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@305"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.04",
            "text": "By contrast, \"chat GPT\" can answer a request about learning large language models with a response that is extremely useful, to the point, and filled with resources such as books, online courses, and research papers.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@309",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@314",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@321",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@328",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@331",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@334",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@336",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@340",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@343",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@346"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.05",
            "text": "We are living at a stage where research in natural language processing has made LLMs such as GPT very powerful and very sophisticated.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@349",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@354",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@356",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@360",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@363",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@367"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.06",
            "text": "Generative AI is broader than language alone and includes video, audio, and 3D models.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@500",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@503",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@506"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.07",
            "text": "Some videos can look incredibly realistic even though they are made entirely by artificial intelligence rather than shot on a camera.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@511",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@514",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@519",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@522",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@524",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@527",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@530"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p02",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.01",
            "text": "The same shift appears in interactive text generation.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.02",
            "text": "A prompt such as \"plan a relaxing day\" can ask for a day focused on rejuvenation and request that the system first ask about favorite forms of relaxation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@277",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@279",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@280",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@284",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@286",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@289"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.03",
            "text": "\"chat GPT\" replies conversationally, asking whether the user prefers being outdoors, reading, yoga, painting, or cooking.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@290",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@294",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@297",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@299",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@301",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@303",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@306",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@308"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.04",
            "text": "If the answer is \"reading a book\", it generates a reading-focused plan with items such as morning meditation, breakfast, reading time, and a nature walk.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@313",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@315",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@318",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@320",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@323",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@325",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@326",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@329",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@331",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@334"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.05",
            "text": "This kind of demonstration shows that large language models understand, generate, and respond to human-like text, and that they also respond like humans.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@247",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@250",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@340",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@342",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@345",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@348"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.06",
            "text": "They are sounding more and more like humans.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@384",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@386",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@389"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p03",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.01",
            "text": "These capabilities lead directly to practical applications.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.02",
            "text": "The applications of large language models can be divided into five main categories, even though there are several more applications beyond these.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1549",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1552",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1554",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1776",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1778",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1781",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1783",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1785"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.03",
            "text": "One category is creating new content that may not already exist.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1556",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1558",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1577",
