              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1583"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.04",
            "text": "For example, a model can write a poem about the solar system in the format of a detective story, and it can also be used to write books and generate media articles.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1560",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1566",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1570",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1573",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1577",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1580",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1587",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1606",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1608",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1611"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.05",
            "text": "Another category is chatbot or virtual-assistant use, where a person can interact with the model in an ongoing conversation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1615",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1618",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1621",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1625",
